==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{af|ru|про-|-йти́}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|пройти́}}
* {{ru-IPA|phon=пройдти́|gem=y}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-пройти.ogg}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|пройти́|pf|impf=проходи́ть<q:suppletive>}}

# to [[pass]], to [[go]], to [[walk]]
# to [[pass by]]
# ''(time)'' to [[pass]], to [[go by]], to [[elapse]], to [[slip by]]
#: {{ux|ru|[[не|Не]] '''прошло́''' [[и]] [[неделя|неде́ли]], [[как]] [[тюльпа́н]] [[зацвести|зацвёл]] [[в]] [[горшок|горшке́]].|A tulip was blooming on a flowerpot in less than a week.|lit=A week didn't '''pass''', but the tulip was blooming on a flowerpot.}}
#: {{ux|ru|[[не|Не]] '''пройдёт''' [[и]] [[полго́да]].|Not even half a year will pass.}}
# to [[be]] [[over]]
# ''(meeting, gathering)'' to [[go off]], to be [[held]]
# to [[study]], to [[cover]] (in a course)

